  "description": "Jung Dayeon, a webtoon artist and a cat owner saves a young heir from a dog and the next day suddenly a butler appears at her house, what's more the butler has cat ears and a tail?!\n\n\"I am Nyangjji from Planet Nya, a planet far from Earth. I have been ordered to be a servant here for one year.\"\n\nA hilarious human documentary about cat butlers that appeared out of nowhere.\n\n(Source: Kakao Webtoon, translated)",
